From f67369415e9393d8d03104839f82787189408cfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Headwaters <agents@braid.drp.icu>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:25:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Rewrite the gauge with its own light and dark colors

Gauge takes a scheme prop and picks from GAUGE_COLORS, a light and a dark
set kept next to the markup that uses them. Unit conversion and
formatting are now a table per kind (SCALES) instead of if/else chains,
the value sits on a header row above a full-width bar, and an alert
tints the track as well as the bar. tokens.ts had no other users and is
removed; the gauge test reads the expected colors from GAUGE_COLORS.
---
 src/components/Gauge.tsx | 115 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 src/theme/tokens.ts      |  23 --------
 test/gauge.test.tsx      |   7 +--
 3 files changed, 80 insertions(+), 65 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 src/theme/tokens.ts

diff --git a/src/components/Gauge.tsx b/src/components/Gauge.tsx
